{"availability":"available","full":"FluidInference/FluidAudio","name":"FluidAudio","description":"Frontier CoreML audio models in your apps — text-to-speech, speech-to-text, voice activity detection, and speaker diarization. In Swift, powered by SOTA open source. ","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Swift","stars":3129,"forks":477,"created":"2025-06-21T21:09:30Z","updated":"2026-10-16T18:22:32Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://docs.fluidinference.com/introduction","topics":["ane","asr","audio","automatic-speech-recognition","avfoundation","coreml","ios","macos","nvidia","parakeet","real-time","speaker-diarization","speaker-embedding","speaker-identification","speaker-recognition","speech-to-text","swift","vad","voice-activity-detection"],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/FluidInference/nemotron-3-diarization-coreml","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:21.210Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:21.210Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:21.210Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:21.210Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"x","name":"As Seen On X.com","url":"https://x.com/i/web/status/2102820221744484762","postId":"2102820221744484762","postedAt":"2026-09-23T17:59:44.000Z"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T20:03:48.697Z","stars":3012,"forks":464},{"at":"2026-10-11T21:45:56.956Z","stars":3018,"forks":467},{"at":"2026-10-12T16:19:56.834Z","stars":3023,"forks":467},{"at":"2026-10-18T22:45:21.210Z","stars":3129,"forks":477}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["FluidAudio is a Swift SDK for fully local, low-latency audio AI on Apple devices, with inference offloaded to the Apple Neural Engine (ANE), resulting in less memory and generally faster inference.","The SDK includes state-of-the-art speaker diarization, transcription, and voice activity detection via open-source models (MIT/Apache 2.0) that can be integrated with just a few lines of code. Models are optimized for background processing, ambient computing and always on workloads by running inference on the ANE, minimizing CPU usage and avoiding GPU/MPS entirely.","For custom use cases, feedback, additional model support, or platform requests, join our Discord. We're also bringing visual, language, and TTS models to device and will share updates there."],"features":["Automatic Speech Recognition (ASR): Parakeet TDT v3 (0.6b) and other TDT/CTC models for batch transcription supporting 25 European languages and Japanese, plus SenseVoice and Paraformer for Mandarin Chinese; Parakeet…","Inverse Text Normalization (ITN): Post-process ASR output to convert spoken-form to written-form (\"two hundred\" → \"200\"). See text-processing-rs. Optional: ASR-only apps can drop the engine (8 MB per slice) with traits:…","Speaker Diarization (Online + Offline): Speaker separation and identification across audio streams. Streaming pipeline for real-time processing and offline batch pipeline with advanced clustering.","Speaker Embedding Extraction: Generate speaker embeddings for voice comparison and clustering, you can use this for speaker identification","Voice Activity Detection (VAD): Voice activity detection with Silero models"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/FluidInference/FluidAudio/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0a31e3c24393dc74650af5d2d9215cab97d44b449add89d644ef63dc74aaf0da","extractedAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:21.276Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:21.276Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"FluidAudio is a Swift SDK for fully local, low-latency audio AI on Apple devices, with inference offloaded to the Apple Neural Engine (ANE), resulting in less memory and generally faster inference.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/FluidInference/FluidAudio/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"optional","text":"Use the WeSpeaker/Pyannote pipeline only when you specifically need its modular design despite the speed cost","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/FluidInference/FluidAudio/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"0a31e3c24393dc74650af5d2d9215cab97d44b449add89d644ef63dc74aaf0da","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/FluidInference/FluidAudio/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:21.277Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-16T18:22:32Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/FluidInference/FluidAudio/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:21.278Z","hash":"0a31e3c24393dc74650af5d2d9215cab97d44b449add89d644ef63dc74aaf0da","originalBytes":48934,"storedBytes":48934,"truncated":false},"demoEvidence":{"kind":"x_link","repository":"FluidInference/FluidAudio","postUrl":"https://x.com/i/web/status/2102820221744484762","url":"https://huggingface.co/FluidInference/nemotron-3-diarization-coreml"},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/FluidInference/nemotron-3-diarization-coreml","attemptedAt":"2026-10-18T23:04:09.774Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T23:04:09.774Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-18T23:04:09.774Z","target":"https://huggingface.co/FluidInference/nemotron-3-diarization-coreml","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-25T23:04:09.774Z"},"previewCheck":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/FluidInference/nemotron-3-diarization-coreml","attemptedAt":"2026-10-18T23:04:09.774Z","consecutiveFailures":0,"status":"captured","reason":null,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-25T23:04:09.774Z"},"screenshots":[{"src":"previews/ad14e79fbef852e451954311.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-18T23:04:09.774Z","url":"https://huggingface.co/FluidInference/nemotron-3-diarization-coreml"}],"subjects":["Apple","Mobile","Image, audio & video AI"],"platforms":["iOS & iPadOS","macOS"],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"AI & machine learning","subjects":["Apple","Mobile","Image, audio & video AI"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Apple","source":"metadata","match":"CoreML"},{"subject":"Mobile",